//
// --- LEGAL: Byte Access with char* ---
// Value: 0x12345678
// Bytes (little-endian): 78 56 34 12   <- char* can alias anything
//
// --- SAFE: Type Punning with memcpy ---
// Float value: 3.14159
// Bit pattern: 0x40490fd0             <- Safe type punning
//
// --- LEGAL: Signed/Unsigned Correspondence ---
// Unsigned: 4294967295
// As signed: -1                        <- OK by strict aliasing
//
// --- LEGAL: Base Class Access ---
// Accessing Derived through Base*: 100 <- Base class access allowed
//
// --- LEGAL: Aggregate Member Access ---
// Point.x via member pointer: 10
// Point first member via cast: 10      <- Aggregate member access OK
//
